    "accession": "PXD021709",
    "title": "BioID of PAX8 in human ovarian cancer cells",
    "additionalAttributes": [],
    "projectDescription": "Investigation of interactors for the human transcription factor PAX8 using BioID-based proximity labeling, as described in Galli et al.",
    "sampleProcessingProtocol": "A PAX8-BioID construct was introduced in the endogenous PAX8 locus of IGROV-1 cells using CRISPR. Biotinylated proteins were purified with Streptavidin and analysed by quantitative mass spectrometry using TMT labeling.",
    "dataProcessingProtocol": "Mass spec data was processed using Thermo Proteome Discoverer and a set of in-house Python scripts.",
